#: ../../doc/old/old/read/tir/expr/Ramp.ipynb:30002
msgid "源码：`tvm/include/tvm/tir/expr.h`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../doc/old/old/read/tir/expr/Ramp.ipynb:70002
msgid ""
"`RampNode` 类，它继承自 `PrimExprNode`。这个类用于构建具有多个元素的向量，其中第 `i` 个元素等于 `base + i"
" * stride`。这在构造连续向量加载的索引时非常有用。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../doc/old/old/read/tir/expr/Ramp.ipynb:70004
msgid "类中有三个成员变量："
msgstr ""

#: ../../doc/old/old/read/tir/expr/Ramp.ipynb:70005
msgid "`base`：表示向量的起始值。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../doc/old/old/read/tir/expr/Ramp.ipynb:70006
msgid "`stride`：表示每个步长的跨度。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../doc/old/old/read/tir/expr/Ramp.ipynb:70007
msgid "`lanes`：表示向量的总元素个数。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../doc/old/old/read/tir/expr/Ramp.ipynb:70009
msgid "类中还包含了三个方法："
msgstr ""

#: ../../doc/old/old/read/tir/expr/Ramp.ipynb:70010
msgid "`VisitAttrs`：用于访问类的属性。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../doc/old/old/read/tir/expr/Ramp.ipynb:70011
msgid "`SEqualReduce`：用于比较两个 `RampNode` 对象是否相等。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../doc/old/old/read/tir/expr/Ramp.ipynb:70012
msgid "`SHashReduce`：用于计算 `RampNode` 对象的哈希值。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../doc/old/old/read/tir/expr/Ramp.ipynb:70014
msgid ""
"此外，类中还定义了静态常量字符串 `_type_key`，用于表示类的类型，以及宏 "
"`TVM_DECLARE_FINAL_OBJECT_INFO`，用于声明类的相关信息。"
msgstr ""

